{"id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-substitution-formula.md","title":"Free substitution and deterministic capture avoidance","display":"df-substitution-formula — Free substitution and deterministic capture avoidance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-substitution-formula","aliases":["72-df-substitution-formula"],"display":"df-substitution-formula — Free substitution and deterministic capture avoidance","depends_on":["[[72-df-free-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files","source_kind":"local-reconstruction","verification_status":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-substitution-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-substitution-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-formula — Free substitution and deterministic capture avoidance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_U,\\operatorname{AV}_U,\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_U,\\operatorname{AV}_U,\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,s\">\\(t,u,s\\)</span> 为项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为基本公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V\">\\(x,y,z\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)\\)</span> 将项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 中的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)\\)</span> 是下式定义的全定义捕获避免代入，不对公式取未指定的α等价代表。量词冲突分支使用最小下标新变量；递归以公式的逻辑构造子数为良基度量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\{y\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\{y\\}\\)</span> 时调用，是下式给出的自由变量改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\)</span> 是不改名的代入合法性谓词。下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 都是本文件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的允许实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(y,s,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(c,s,x)&amp;:=c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(f(\\vec t),s,x)&amp;:=f((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(y,s,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(c,s,x)&amp;:=c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(f(\\vec t),s,x)&amp;:=f((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow 0=0\\quad(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\neg A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A\\lor B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\forall yA)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\lor(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y)&amp;:=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,P)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow 0=0\\quad(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\neg A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A\\lor B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\forall yA)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\lor(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y)&amp;:=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,z,y)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,z,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(P(\\vec t))&amp;:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,z,y))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A\\lor B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A)\\lor\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\forall wA)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&amp;w=y,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),&amp;w\\ne y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,z,y)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,z,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(P(\\vec t))&amp;:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,z,y))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A\\lor B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A)\\lor\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\forall wA)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&amp;w=y,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),&amp;w\\ne y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(t\\doteq u,s,x)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(P(\\vec t),s,x)&amp;:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\neg A,s,x)&amp;:=\\neg\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A\\lor B,s,x)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)\\lor\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(B,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\forall yA,s,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A),\\\\\n\\forall y\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\\\\n\\forall z\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),s,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\ z=\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[s/x]&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}^{\\rm free}_U&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U\\restriction\\{(A,s,x):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land x\\in V\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(t\\doteq u,s,x)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(P(\\vec t),s,x)&amp;:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\neg A,s,x)&amp;:=\\neg\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A\\lor B,s,x)&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)\\lor\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(B,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\forall yA,s,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A),\\\\\n\\forall y\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\\\\n\\forall z\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),s,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\ z=\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[s/x]&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}^{\\rm free}_U&amp;:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U\\restriction\\{(A,s,x):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land x\\in V\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐缺失的三参数项替换与公式替换接口，并将“先作适当新鲜改名”落实为确定函数。新鲜变量的排除集有限，因此最小下标存在。改名保持公式逻辑构造子数，量词分支的后续代入仍处理严格较小的公式；递归全定义。72-df-calculus-syntax中的扩充语法代入仍是其原有FreeFor定义域上的部分函数，不能把两者混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$、$V$、$\\operatorname{FV}_U,\\operatorname{AV}_U,\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]]。$t,u,s$ 为项，$A,B$ 为基本公式，$x,y,z\\in V$。$\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)$ 将项 $t$ 中的变量 $x$ 替换为 $s$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_U,\\operatorname{AV}_U,\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,s","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\{y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(y,s,x)&:=\\begin{cases}s,&y=x,\\\\y,&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}&\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(c,s,x)&:=c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(f(\\vec t),s,x)&:=f((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i<|\\vec t|}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,P)&:\\Longleftrightarrow 0=0\\quad(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\neg A)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A\\lor B)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,\\forall yA)&:\\Longleftrightarrow y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\lor(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y)&:=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}_U(A)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(t\\doteq u)&:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,z,y)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,z,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(P(\\vec t))&:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,z,y))_{i<|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\neg A)&:=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A\\lor B)&:=\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A)\\lor\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\forall wA)&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&w=y,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),&w\\ne y.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(t\\doteq u,s,x)&:=\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t,s,x)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(u,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(P(\\vec t),s,x)&:=P((\\mathrm{SubTrm}_U(t_i,s,x))_{i<|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\neg A,s,x)&:=\\neg\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A\\lor B,s,x)&:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x)\\lor\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(B,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\forall yA,s,x)&:=\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_U(A),\\\\\n\\forall y\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),&y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\\\\n\\forall z\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(A),s,x),&y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\land y\\in\\operatorname{VarTerm}_U(s),\\ z=\\operatorname{Fresh}_U(A,s,x,y),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[s/x]&:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U(A,s,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SubFml}^{\\rm free}_U&:=\\mathrm{SubFml}_U\\restriction\\{(A,s,x):A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land x\\in V\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_U(s,x,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4219,"backlinks":[{"id":"d506b73ecaab7431","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]]；$A[u/x]$ 使用 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的捕获避免代入。$m_{A,x}$、$z_{A,x,y,t}$ 用固定变量枚举 $v_i$ 选取最小下标的新鲜变量。"},{"id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A[t/x]$ 取 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(A,t,x)$；该接口以最小新变量实现确定性的捕获避免，不另行选择未指定的改名代表。"},{"id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"新联结词采用与原子及原有构造子互不相撞的标签；$A\\circ B$ 中 $\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。以下递归在有限语法树上进行；$\\operatorname{VarTerm}$ 取 [[72-df-free-variable]] 的同一五分量签名递归，$\\mathrm{SubTrm}$ 取 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的项替换。$A[t/x]$ 只在 $\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)$ 时使用。"},{"id":"633c2d970d6483e6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A(\\vec x,z)$ 使用 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}(A,z,y)$；采用该接口的确定性捕获避免代入，不把选择改名代表留给读者。"},{"id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 为有效一阶语言或签名，$X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)$，$V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S$。语法、全称闭包和代入分别取 [[72-df-first-order-formula]]、[[72-df-free-variable]]、[[72-df-substitution-formula]]。"},{"id":"359d2fc3caebbb0d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["fdc2c33e939db2f8"]}